      },
      "text": "Flow batteries decouple energy capacity (tank size) from power rating (electrochemical\nstack size). This separation is architecturally significant: it is the battery equivalent\nof a gas turbine where fuel storage is separate from the engine. It makes flow batteries\nideal for long-duration grid storage where Li-ion's fixed energy/power ratio is a constraint."
    },
