      "text": "POSITIVE ELECTRODE (cathode during charge, anode during discharge):\n  VO2+ + H2O -> VO2+ + 2H+ + e-  (charge, oxidation)\n  VO2+ + 2H+ + e- -> VO2+ + H2O  (discharge, reduction)\n  E° = +1.00 V vs. SHE"
    },
    {
