      },
      "text": "FULL CELL:\n  V2+ | membrane | VO2+  discharge: cell voltage ~ 1.26 V (standard)\n  V3+ | membrane | VO2+  fully discharged: lower voltage\n  Open circuit at full SOC: ~1.4-1.6 V (concentration-dependent via Nernst)"
    },
    {
